  "intro": [
    "Start a fresh Leather Goddesses of Phobos (V3) game and enter the commands below exactly. The numbered route includes every typed command, including the final QUIT.",
    "The Martian Canal beam is lethal. After the frog, acquire the mouse by the cell-and-roof loop, return to the Palace, send the barge away with “push orange,” then use the well route to arrive at Icy Dock without crossing the beam.",
    "After rescuing Elysia, follow the corridor to the hidden circle and return to My Kinda Dock. At Trent’s Plaza exchange, give the eight listed items in order. Use <ENTER> for the scratch-and-sniff input, then QUIT after the 248-point ending."
  ],
